  "question": {
    "html": "<p>An electron of non-relativistic speed <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span> interacts with an atom. All the energy of the electron is transferred to an emitted photon of frequency <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f\"></span> . An electron of speed <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2v\"></span> now interacts with the same atom and all its energy is transmitted to a second photon. What is the frequency of the second photon?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{f}{4}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{f}{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2f\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4f\"></span></li></ol>"
